        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>The Kwikset 665, Residential Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nKwikset's Double Cylinder Deadbolt offers ANSI Grade 3 security. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses up to 1-3/4 inches. Operated by a key on the exterior and the interior of the door. It has a lifetime mechanical warranty from Kwikset for tough, effective protection at an affordable price.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted on both the inside and the outside by a key. Since it is keyed on both sides of the door, it is typically used on entry doors with glass near the lock to prevent thieves from breaking the glass and unlocking the deadbolt using a thumbturn.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>Smartkey</b> Kwikset Lock offers convenience and security. It allows you to re-key the lock yourself without removing from the door; this mean you will be able to key all your SmartKey locks to one Kwikset key.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/grade-3-single-cylinder-deadbolt-kwikset-660\"><b>Single Cylinder Kwikset 660 Deadbolt</b></a></p>\r\n \r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grade 3 Kwikset 665 Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>ANSI Grade 3 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Kwikset SmartKey lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt  Throw.</li>\r\n<li>All-metal mechanics.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for both 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" square corner</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grade 3 Double Cylinder Deadbolt, Kwikset 665",
